# HARD — 7-step first; Auto-LF once after section 7

**Scope:** Email processing chat (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

## Absolute order (EMAIL)

```
EXTRACT (script): run.py / await-arm — NO Auto-LF spawn for EMAIL

AGENT MESSAGE (text-only):
 Optional: Read latest_extract.md
 Write CHANNEL: EMAIL / Fall # / sections 1–7 as PLAIN chat text
 End: "7-step complete — Auto-LF starts after this message."
 STOP. NO fill_case_tracker. NO --closeout-* in this message.

BACKGROUND (once, automatic — NOT audio):
 re_auto_lf_hook (afterAgentResponse text) detects section 7 / 7-step-complete
 → spawns auto_lf_after_re.py
 → fill_case_tracker (from §3 / Sprinklr) + closeout arm-only + bg await

Audio cues are **REMOVED** — never play, never trigger processing.
Use arm → extract_ready → `--await-arm` / `[AUTO_PIPELINE]` → `re_auto_lf_hook` only.

Agent must NOT run a second LF for the same Fall # if auto_lf_done.json / Speichern pending already has it.
```

## Why not at extract

Extract-time Auto-LF + a second LF after the agent read the email caused **two Case Tracker fills per case**. LF now waits until the full 7-step (with correct §3) is typed.

## Hard bans

1. `fill_case_tracker` / `--closeout-*` **before** the full 7-step is visible for this Fall #
2. `AUTO_LF_AT_EXTRACT_SPAWNED` / extract-time LF for EMAIL (removed)
3. Running Auto-LF twice for the same Fall # (skip if already filed)
4. Putting LF tools in the same message as the 7-step (collapses RE)
5. Task/explore for RE / LF

## CALL exception

`CHANNEL: CALL` → Auto-LF voice immediately in same turn (no email 7-step).

